@startuml
!include diagrams/style.iuml

start
:A test step ends;
switch (What happened?)
case (the checked\ncondition held)
  #eefaf1:**PASS**;
case (an assertion\ndid not hold)
  #fbeeee:**FAIL**
  the product is wrong
  -> look at the product;
case (crash | missing keyword | import error\nbench not ready | unexpected exception)
  #fdf5e6:**UNKNOWN**
  nothing could be judged
  -> look at the bench / the test;
endswitch
:return code = (unknown << 4) | failed
CI can tell the two apart without opening the log;
stop
@enduml
